Package: mufflyaccess
Title: Canonical Access, Census-Denominator, and Geography Constants (SSOT)
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Tyler", "Muffly", email = "tyler.muffly@dhha.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Single source of truth for the constants shared across the OB/GYN
    subspecialty geographic-access projects (isochrones, twostep, cliff): the
    primary drive-time access band, the total-female access denominator category
    label, the tract "reached" majority-coverage cut, the national contiguous-US
    ACS female population, and the contiguous-US / non-contiguous state code
    lists. Each value carries provenance and fail-loud validation so the three
    repositories cannot silently drift. Intentionally-different, repo-specific
    values (e.g. the Wu-2014 vs Nygaard-2008 PFD prevalence tables) are NOT
    included here and stay per-repository by design.
